              "jcr:created": "Fri Oct 01 2021 17:37:38 GMT+0000",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "line1": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5-vw\">Product discontinuation notice</span></span></h1>\r\n",
              "line2": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">Stryker has announced the end of support for the <b>LIFEPAK 12 monitor/defibrillator, LIFEPAK 20 defibrillator/monitor, LIFEPAK 500 defibrillator,</b> and <b>HeartSine samaritan PAD 300 and 300P.&nbsp;</b></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">Products not affected: We are pleased to have PMA approval for our core automated external defibrillator (AED) portfolio: <b>LIFEPAK 15, LIFEPAK 1000, LIFEPAK 20e, LIFEPAK CR2, LIFEPAK CR Plus</b> and the <b>HeartSine</b> family of AEDs.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jul 27 2022 20:29:08 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/largeheadline",
              "backgroundColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0)",
              "textIsRich": [
                "true",
                "true"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
